speechtext:
1.	What is the hourly rate of wages now being paid to printers at the government printing bureau (a) for day work; (b) for night work?
2.	How many hours per week do printers work at the government printing bureau before overtime rates begin, and what are the overtime rates?
3.	What is the hourly rate of wages now being paid to printers working in commercial shops (a) for day work; (b) for night work, in (i) Ottawa;
(ii)	Montreal; (iii) Toronto?
4.	How many hours per week do printers work in commercial shops, in (i) Ottawa; (ii) Montreal;
(iii)	Toronto, before overtime rates begin, and what are such overtime rates?
5.	What is the hourly rate of wages now being paid to printers working in newspaper shops (a) for day work; (b) for night work, in (i) Ottawa;
(ii)	Montreal; (iii) Toronto?
6.	How many 'hours per week do printers work in newspaper shops, in (i) Ottawa; (ii) Montreal;
(iii)	Toronto, before overtime rates begin, and what are such overtime rates?
